{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>And you shall make two rings of gold</b> — additional ones — <b>and you shall put them on the two edges of the breastpiece, on its lip</b> — the lower one — <b>which is toward the side of the ephod inward.</b> That is, at the edges of the lower lips that stand opposite the edges of the ephod that are folded and come forward a bit, as we said; that is, at its inner corners that are attached to the robe — and this is what 'inward' means."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:00:54.688768549Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}